<p>Briefly extend your telekinetic reach to grab an enemy, haul them towards you and daze them for 1 turn.</p><p>Works on enemies up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 6, 6</acronym> squares away.</p><p>The cooldown decreases, and the range increases, with additional talent points spent.</p>